## Hard invariants

- Medusa backend = source of truth; storefront = thin client; no BFF/GraphQL/microservices/core fork
- RoomSet is its own entity
- `BESPOKE` → request_quote only; never cart; middleware blocks
- Kids = navigation layer (`src/lib/kids.ts`), not ProductClassification; shared cart
- No seed/apply/ingest/media-apply/DB write/publish without explicit approval
- No secrets in git/md/tmp/logs/prompts/screenshots
- Foreground-only; no auto `yarn dev` / `medusa develop`; ports `:3002` / `:9000`

