## Git hard bans (no permission → do not)

`git add -A`, `git add .`, commit, push, force push, amend, reset, stash, clean, checkout/restore of unrelated files, deleting untracked, “fixing” unrelated dirty tree.

Dirty files: **patch/hunk staging only**; review `git diff --staged --stat`, `--name-only`, and scoped staged diff before commit. Never stage whole pre-dirty file blindly.

Push/PR operational detail: alwaysApply `github-access.mdc` (do not invent a second policy here).

