## Codex decision table (canonical — others only link here)

**Required if any:**
- staged commit gate
- backend / business logic
- DB / schema / migrations
- pricing / cart / ProductClassification
- Media Ops apply; legacy migration / apply / publish
- security / credentials-sensitive
- broad refactor; mixed / high-blast-radius diff
- AI governance / `.cursor/rules` changes
- dirty-file patch staging before commit
- after closing P1/P2 findings from a prior review

**Recommended:** medium storefront impl; new shared component; complex a11y; multi query/filter flows

**Not required:** informational answer; read-only lookup no edits; tiny low-risk text/CSS **without** commit; mid-task status; docs typo without commit and without governance/security impact
